  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kenya &#x2013; Sustainable mobility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With a DGGF start-up loan Ebee International BV will be able to grow its fleet of e-bikes and scale up related operations which are offered through a vehicle-as-a-service model in Kenya through local subsidiary eBee Mobility Kenya ltd. The e-bikes are the first ones to be designed and developed for Africa and focus on B2B and B2C clients that are active in the local last mile delivery market.</narrative>
  </description>
